message: 'If you use SafeUnfollow in your work, please cite it as below.'
title: SafeUnfollow
abstract: 'Find out who unfollowed you on Instagram. SafeUnfollow reads the official Instagram data export and computes unfollowers, non-mutuals and mutuals entirely in the browser; the export never leaves the device. No login, no server, no Instagram API.'
type: software
